adr: 0361
file: tools/apconfig.pas
kills: new-project
why: Only the first element of an array is written out, so a project whose second link flag is what fails links anyway. It is the other half of what the `awk` subset got wrong about arrays -- that one split them on every comma, so the *pair* of claims in new_project.sh step 7 is what the reader has to satisfy, not either alone.
--- old
        for k := 1 to TomlCount(w) do
          Emit(full, TomlAt(w, k))
--- new
        for k := 1 to 1 do
          Emit(full, TomlAt(w, k))
